# Copy to .env.local (gitignored). Development runs on the local Supabase stack (`supabase start` on OrbStack, decision
# 2026-10-29, design §22.18); the values below are its public demo keys (`supabase status` confirms them).
# The hosted project (the shared demo and what Vercel runs) lives in .env.hosted.local, reached with `pnpm hosted …`:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL      https://<ref>.supabase.co
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY the legacy "anon" JWT (Project Settings › API Keys › Legacy API keys)
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY     the legacy "service_role" JWT (server-only, rule 12)
#   SUPABASE_DB_PASSWORD          the database password
#   DATABASE_URL / TEST_DATABASE_URL  the transaction pooler: postgresql://postgres.<ref>:<password>@aws-0-<region>.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres
# The demo seed on that project needs DEMO_SEED=1 and DEMO_SEED_REMOTE=1 (the demo passwords are public).
# Its access tokens must live 10 minutes like the local stack's (supabase/config.toml `jwt_expiry = 600`, design §22.19):
# set Authentication › Sessions › JWT expiry to 600 seconds in the hosted project's dashboard.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:55321
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZS1kZW1vIiwicm9sZSI6ImFub24iLCJleHAiOjE5ODM4MTI5OTZ9.CRXP1A7WOeoJeXxjNni43kdQwgnWNReilDMblYTn_I0
# Server-only (rule 12): never expose it to the browser.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZS1kZW1vIiwicm9sZSI6InNlcnZpY2Vfcm9sZSIsImV4cCI6MTk4MzgxMjk5Nn0.EGIM96RAZx35lJzdJsyH-qQwv8Hdp7fsn3W0YpN81IU
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@127.0.0.1:54322/postgres

# The assistant's model. Set AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY to use the AI Gateway with the models of kernel.model_policies.
# Without a key, uncomment AGENT_MODEL=mock to run the turns with the AI SDK mock model, a test double that understands
# «busca el cliente …» and «crea el cliente …, NIT …» (a production server refuses it unless ALLOW_MOCK_MODEL=1).
AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
# AGENT_MODEL=mock
